# Chapter 13, worked example: the database statistical @functions with a
# criteria range
A1 Name
B1 Dept
C1 Salary
A2 Adams
B2 Software
C2 32000
A3 Baker
B3 Software
C3 31500
A4 Clark
B4 Software
C4 31000
A5 Davis
B5 Payroll
C5 24000
E1 Dept
E2 Software
F1 @DSUM(A1..C5,2,E1..E2)
F2 @DCOUNT(A1..C5,2,E1..E2)
F3 @DAVG(A1..C5,2,E1..E2)
F4 @DMAX(A1..C5,2,E1..E2)
show F1
show F2
show F3
show F4
E4 Salary
E5 +C2>31000
F5 @DCOUNT(A1..C5,0,E4..E5)
show F5
